00:47:09.440 --> 00:47:10.280
I saw it clearly.

00:47:10.360 --> 00:47:10.960
A woman too.

00:47:11.230 --> 00:47:11.880
Mr. Gu, look.

00:47:12.360 --> 00:47:13.230
What's that?

